   (https://github.com/relatedb/relate) as a Swift package dependency, and
   the web app depends on its WebAssembly build (@relate/relate-wasm on npm).
   Neither is included in this repository. Relate is licensed under the
   Apache License, Version 2.0, Copyright 2026 The Relate Authors.

